        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "A single ultra-wide view of one location, filmed by one camera with one lens. <Video 1> is a crop of this view and shows only one part of the frame. <Picture 1> is the first frame of <Video 1>. The rest of the frame shows the area right next to <Video 1>, in the same place, at the same moment, from the same camera position. Floors, walls, ground, sky, horizon and lighting from <Video 1> run straight across the whole frame with the same perspective, scale, color and exposure, with no border anywhere. The camera moves exactly as in <Video 1>, with the same direction, speed and timing, and the whole frame moves together with that one camera movement.\nNegative: no split screen / no panels / no second viewpoint / no different camera angle / no frame within a frame / no cuts"
      ],
